    "detailed_description": "Zero-based World is a 3D Low-Poly sandbox game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Philosophical Story</h2><br><strong>Dream is essential for everyday life, so is imagination.</strong><br><br>One day, when you fall into a sound sleep, this world will form in silence.<br>Your imagination is the foundation of the dream world where you can create everything.<br>The stronger you are, the clearer the world will be.<br><br><br><strong>Every time when you awaken from a dream, do you always have the feeling that you might have forgotten something?</strong><br><br>All frustrations come from your imagination.<br>Every time when you wake up, what will your choice be? To forget all about the past, or to find back your memory and confront your inner world?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Infinite Open World</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c84efd31d74a55c965d862d710d66a5f.poster.avif?t=1654203848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c84efd31d74a55c965d862d710d66a5f.webm?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c84efd31d74a55c965d862d710d66a5f.mp4?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A great fancy land is waiting for you to imagine.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Living Nature</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c062e9ac917d29b44a6e08f6143ff600.poster.avif?t=1654203848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c062e9ac917d29b44a6e08f6143ff600.webm?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c062e9ac917d29b44a6e08f6143ff600.mp4?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Traveling through immersive nature environments, from daylight to moonlight, from drizzle to thunderstorm, the weather and nature cycling will bring you a vivid and unique feeling that will stay in your mind for a long time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cooperation</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/b6092b2f2554b6e2f46a85f2142afca8.poster.avif?t=1654203848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/b6092b2f2554b6e2f46a85f2142afca8.webm?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/b6092b2f2554b6e2f46a85f2142afca8.mp4?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Team up with your friends, to make adventures and to fight!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Taming &amp; Riding</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/60f1e68f572ef1829835e66ca6734da5.avif?t=1654203848\" /></div><br>Tame various creatures and turn them into your loyal partners.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Homeland</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/13811a7a98fe86512bdd930cdac42259.avif?t=1654203848\" /></div><br>Build up your own homeland and realize your dream.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deeper Dreamland</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/945284443e643f0dd90bf2fe4dd984bc.avif?t=1654203848\" /></div><br>Explore the mysterious underground world and hunt for the rarest and most valuable treasure.",
    "about_the_game": "Zero-based World is a 3D Low-Poly sandbox game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Philosophical Story</h2><br><strong>Dream is essential for everyday life, so is imagination.</strong><br><br>One day, when you fall into a sound sleep, this world will form in silence.<br>Your imagination is the foundation of the dream world where you can create everything.<br>The stronger you are, the clearer the world will be.<br><br><br><strong>Every time when you awaken from a dream, do you always have the feeling that you might have forgotten something?</strong><br><br>All frustrations come from your imagination.<br>Every time when you wake up, what will your choice be? To forget all about the past, or to find back your memory and confront your inner world?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Infinite Open World</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c84efd31d74a55c965d862d710d66a5f.poster.avif?t=1654203848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c84efd31d74a55c965d862d710d66a5f.webm?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c84efd31d74a55c965d862d710d66a5f.mp4?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>A great fancy land is waiting for you to imagine.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Living Nature</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c062e9ac917d29b44a6e08f6143ff600.poster.avif?t=1654203848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c062e9ac917d29b44a6e08f6143ff600.webm?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/c062e9ac917d29b44a6e08f6143ff600.mp4?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Traveling through immersive nature environments, from daylight to moonlight, from drizzle to thunderstorm, the weather and nature cycling will bring you a vivid and unique feeling that will stay in your mind for a long time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cooperation</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/b6092b2f2554b6e2f46a85f2142afca8.poster.avif?t=1654203848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/b6092b2f2554b6e2f46a85f2142afca8.webm?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/b6092b2f2554b6e2f46a85f2142afca8.mp4?t=1654203848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Team up with your friends, to make adventures and to fight!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Taming &amp; Riding</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/60f1e68f572ef1829835e66ca6734da5.avif?t=1654203848\" /></div><br>Tame various creatures and turn them into your loyal partners.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Homeland</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/13811a7a98fe86512bdd930cdac42259.avif?t=1654203848\" /></div><br>Build up your own homeland and realize your dream.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deeper Dreamland</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1044870/extras/945284443e643f0dd90bf2fe4dd984bc.avif?t=1654203848\" /></div><br>Explore the mysterious underground world and hunt for the rarest and most valuable treasure.",
